      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          I am a senior researcher at the
          <a href="https://en.rockwoolfonden.dk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ROCKWOOL Foundation</a>
          in Copenhagen, Denmark, and a Research Fellow at 
          <a href="https://www.iza.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IZA@LISER</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          My primary research interests are in applied microeconomics, especially labor and health economics.
          My recent work looks into the health and non-health benefits of medical treatments, and into the link
          between health (particularly mental health) and the labor market.
        </p>
